              <desc id="wf-desc">A booking request from the website or WhatsApp goes to an AI agent that reads the treatment and urgency. Urgent cases get a same-day slot held, the appointment is written to the practice software and reception is alerted. Routine requests receive three open slots to choose from.</desc>
